<title>DENMARK: Denmark's Kommunekredit increases 4 pct bond sum.</title>
<headline>Denmark's Kommunekredit increases 4 pct bond sum.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Denmark's Kommunekredit is increasing an existing bond by 31.6 million crowns to 1.284 billion, arranger Gudme Raaschou said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The four percent bond is due in 2002. --Eva Elgaard Pedersen, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33 969650</p>
